  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How to read this view",
      "items": [
        "Each row is an independent guarded transition, not a chronological sequence across rows. Repeated phase labels name the same underlying phase; aliases prevent unrelated rules from sharing ambiguous drawing corridors. The normal-procedure view supplies the connected happy path."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reading this view",
      "items": [
        "snake_case labels are real session.phase strings. Nodes in the 'conceptual step' legend group, or with tag 'conceptual'/'phase group', are not phase strings.",
        "Pilot calls move a phase only after telemetry confirms the claim (_at_hold, _at_crossing, _lined_up). Take-off, landing and vacating come from the mission track alone (airfield.py 44-50)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "_revoke_unstarted (airfield.py 1100-1127)",
      "items": [
        "Only the current lane holder is affected. An aircraft standing on a runway keeps the lane, except that a take-off clearance not yet rolling (15 m/s) is cancelled back to lined_up.",
        "Off the runway, a crossing returns to crossing_requested and any line-up or take-off phase returns to holding_short. In both cases the lane is freed.",
        "Triggers: no readback for 60 model seconds (sets expired, 1030-1036), tower role missing on the channel (1038-1046), another aircraft occupying a runway (1047-1052).",
        "On a runway change, a departure on a runway goes to startup with vacating = True. One off the runway gets a new taxi clearance (1018-1026)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Transition evidence (file lines)",
      "items": [
        "taxi_clearance \u2192 startup: _refresh (597-598); arrival_briefing likewise to inbound_standby (599-600)",
        "crossing \u2192 crossing_requested: not on runway (1117-1121)",
        "line-up \u2192 holding_short: timeout, occupied, tower loss (1030-1052, 1122-1126)",
        "take-off \u2192 lined_up: on runway, not rolling (1108-1112)",
        "lined_up \u2192 startup: on runway: vacating = True (1018-1023, 1575-1578); emergency abort applies to lineup, lined_up or take-off phases on the runway (1575)"
      ]
    }
  ]
